---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { store, asset } from '../config';
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy | AllCare Pharmacy" description="How AllCare Pharmacy handles information sent through this website.">
  <main class="wrap" style="max-width: 760px; padding-top: 56px; padding-bottom: 72px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.6">
    <a href={asset("/")}>← Back to home</a>
    <h1 class="h2">Privacy policy</h1>
    <p>This page explains what happens to information you send through this website. It does not replace our HIPAA Notice of Privacy Practices, which you can request at the pharmacy counter or by calling <a href={store.phoneHref}>{store.phone}</a>.</p>
    <h2 style="font-size: 22px">Contact form</h2>
    <p>When you use the Contact Us form, we receive your name, the contact details you give us, the topic and your message. Our staff use them only to reply to you. Please do not send medication names or health details through the form; call us instead.</p>
    <h2 style="font-size: 22px">Reviews</h2>
    <p>Reviews shown on this site come from our public Google Business Profile.</p>
    <h2 style="font-size: 22px">Spam protection and maps</h2>
    <p>The form uses Cloudflare Turnstile to block spam, and the map is provided by Google Maps. These services may process technical information such as your IP address under their own privacy policies.</p>
    <h2 style="font-size: 22px">Questions</h2>
    <p>Call us at <a href={store.phoneHref}>{store.phone}</a> or email <a href={`mailto:${store.email}`}>{store.email}</a>.</p>
  </main>
</Base>
